    "body": "> This means, for example, if you open a modal dialog, then fullscreen it, then unfullscreen it, it will no longer be in the top layer despite, presumably, still being modal.\r\n\r\nFullscreen explicitly outlaws fullscreening *any* dialog: https://fullscreen.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-element-requestfullscreen",
