    "updated_at": "2023-04-17T20:39:44Z",
    "body": "> has a PR against fullscreen, I think, to do the above. Is that right?\r\n\r\nYes, this PR will hide all popovers when making any element fullscreen. So that means that when an open popover is fullscreened, it will have hidePopover called on it before making it fullscreen: https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/pull/204",
